# The HDF5 files under neural_data/ are small and are tracked.

# python_code/decoding_figures/decoding_results/ is tracked in full: it holds the
# precomputed decoding results — the model outputs, the per-participant
# significance and hemisphere figures under <participant>/figs/, and the
# cross-participant summaries under combined_results/ — which let a reader
# regenerate the decoding figures by running scripts 03, 05 and 06 without re-fitting any
# model. No pattern above may match inside that tree.
#
# Scripts 01-06 overwrite those files in place when re-run, so there is no
# separate generated-output directory to exclude.

